{"v":"1","t":"Namo tassa Bhagavato Arahato Sammāsambuddhassa."},
{"v":"2","t":"Tayo saṅkhārā—kāyasaṅkhāro, vacīsaṅkhāro, cittasaṅkhāroti. Assāsapassāsā kāyasaṅkhāro, vitakkavicārā vacīsaṅkhāro, saññā ca vedanā ca cittasaṅkhāro. Ṭhapetvā vitakkavicāre sabbepi cittasampayuttakā dhammā cittasaṅkhāro."},
